#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:1
msgid "Release 0.16 (2010-08-17)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:3
msgid "This release has the following improvements:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:5
msgid ""
"The Nix expression evaluator is now much faster in most cases: typically, [3 "
"to 8 times compared to the old implementation](http://www.mail-archive.com/"
"nix-dev@cs.uu.nl/msg04113.html). It also uses less memory. It no longer "
"depends on the ATerm library."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:10
msgid ""
"Support for configurable parallelism inside builders. Build scripts have "
"always had the ability to perform multiple build actions in parallel (for "
"instance, by running `make -j                         2`), but this was not "
"desirable because the number of actions to be performed in parallel was not "
"configurable. Nix now has an option `--cores                         N` as "
"well as a configuration setting `build-cores =                         N` "
"that causes the environment variable `NIX_BUILD_CORES` to be set to _N_ when "
"the builder is invoked. The builder can use this at its discretion to "
"perform a parallel build, e.g., by calling `make -j                         "
"N`. In Nixpkgs, this can be enabled on a per-package basis by setting the "
"derivation attribute `enableParallelBuilding` to `true`."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:23
msgid "`nix-store -q` now supports XML output through the `--xml` flag."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.16.md:25
msgid "Several bug fixes."
msgstr ""
